  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the beetroot into small cubes. Cut the red onion\n• into thick wedges.\n• TIP: Wear gloves while you cut the beetroot to\n• prevent stained fingers!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-4ae76434.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the peeled & chopped pumpkin, the\n• beetroot and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle\n• with olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Toss\n• to coat, then roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot is still quite firm even when cooked.\n• It's done when it can be pierced with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-d0168510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, cut the haloumi\n• into 1cm-thick slices. In a shallow bowl, combine\n• the plain flour, sweet mustard spice blend and a\n• good pinch of pepper. In a second shallow bowl,\n• whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place the\n• panko breadcrumbs. Dip the haloumi slices into\n• the flour mixture, followed by the egg, and finally\n• in the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-d708edeb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes cook time left,\n• heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium frying pan\n• over a medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi until\n• golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a\n• plate lined with paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-7b0f83d0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the honey, balsamic\n• vinegar and olive oil (1 tsp for 2 people / 2 tsp for\n• 4 people). Add the roasted veggies and the\n• spinach & rocket mix. Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-3a652dbb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roast veggie toss between plates. Top\n• with the sweet mustard crumbed haloumi. Serve\n• sprinkled with the pepitas and drizzled with the\n• creamy pesto dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61145c911ea213745d5523e2/step-eab7e7e5.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
